zh-Hans\">他很容易忘记人的名字。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安っぽい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やすっぽい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">显得廉价的；俗气的；低劣的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"76302\"><ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でそんな<ruby>安<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っぽいペテンにひっかかるんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">为什么要买这么便宜的宝石?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">休み</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やすみ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">休息；休憩；喘息；假期；假日；缺席；暂停；（蚕在蜕皮前的）休眠状态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"184412\"><ruby>学校<rp>(</rp><rt>がっこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はクリスマスで<ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みになった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学校因圣诞假期放假。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/13972665\" title=\"Tatoeba · Rinrin\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Rinrin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">休む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やすむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缺席；请假；休息；小憩；就寝；睡觉；上床休息；暂时停止；停业</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"84662\"><ruby>父<rp>(</rp><rt>ちち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだ<ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>んでいる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爸爸还在休息。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">休める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やすめる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">休息；暂停；缓解</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221845\">この<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がすんだらたっぷり<ruby>休<rp>(</rp><rt>やす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>める。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个工作会让你休息得太多了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">野生</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">野生的；野生；野生生长；生活在野外；（古语，男性自谦）我；鄙人</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"99416\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>野生<rp>(</rp><rt>やせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>戻<rp>(</rp><rt>もど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りたいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他想回到野生动物。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">痩せる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变瘦；减肥；消瘦；（土壤）变贫瘠；变不毛；变荒芜</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"91287\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はレールのように<ruby>痩<rp>(</rp><rt>や</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">她像雷尔一样沉重。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やたらに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不加选择地；胡乱地；盲目地；过度地；大量地；不加选择的；胡乱的；过度的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"146195\"><ruby>上役<rp>(</rp><rt>うわやく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にやたらにぺこぺこするな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不要在上班上做事。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">矢鱈に</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やたらに</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\"><span lang=\"en\">randomly；recklessly；blindly</span></span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">夜中</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やちゅう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">夜间；夜里；夜晚</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家賃</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やちん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">房租；租金</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186913\"><ruby>家賃<rp>(</rp><rt>やちん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>つき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いくらですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">月租多少钱?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">厄介</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やっかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">麻烦；负担；讨厌的事物；烦恼；困扰；照顾；依赖；扶养；恩惠；义务；寄宿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"204373\">そんなことをするとやっかいなことを<ruby>招<rp>(</rp><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くことになる。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这样做,会引发一些可怕的事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">薬局</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やっきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">药店；药房；医院药房；配药处</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79467\"><ruby>薬局<rp>(</rp><rt>やっきょく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>何時<rp>(</rp><rt>なんじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで<ruby>開<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いていますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">药店开放到什么时候?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">奴</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やっこ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">仆人；武士的侍从；侠客；见义勇为的人（江户时代）；豆腐块；冷豆腐；奴风筝（画成江户时代武家仆从模样的风筝）；奴发型（江户时代武士侍从所梳的发型）；没为奴婢（江户时代刑罚，女子因本人或丈夫犯罪而受罚）；（古，贬）那家伙；那小子；他；她</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">八つ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やっつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"v-m\">八；八个；八岁；两点（旧时制）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"519714\">そこに<ruby>八<rp>(</rp><rt>やっ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つの<ruby>小石<rp>(</rp><rt>こいし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>があった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">那里有八块小圆石。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/8815174\" title=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · crescat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やっつける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">打败；攻击；消灭；除掉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"215893\">ジャイアンツをやっつけろ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把吉安斯拿出来。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やっと</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">终于</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\">やっと<ruby>宿題<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅくだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>終<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わりました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">作业终于写完了。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">やっぱり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">果然；正如所料；不出所料；毕竟；终究；到底；果然如此；也；亦；同样；（否定句中）也不；依然；仍然；如前；仍然；还是；尽管如此；即便如此</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"193053\">やっぱり<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とかやってのけたね。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你一定做了一些事情。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">野党</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">反对党；在野党</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"143147\"><ruby>政府<rp>(</rp><rt>せいふ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>政策<rp>(</rp><rt>せいさく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>野党<rp>(</rp><rt>やとう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から<ruby>非難<rp>(</rp><rt>ひなん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>された。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">政府的政策被反对派谴责。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">雇う</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やとう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">雇用；聘用；雇佣；包租（车、船等）；租用（车、船等）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110855\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はまだその<ruby>会社<rp>(</rp><rt>かいしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>雇<rp>(</rp><rt>やと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他仍然被该公司雇用。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">宿</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やど</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">旅馆；客栈；酒店；家；住所；住宅；仆人父母（或担保人等）的住处</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"147898\"><ruby>宿<rp>(</rp><rt>やど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>主人<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>召使<rp>(</rp><rt>めしつか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>達<rp>(</rp><rt>たち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にがなりたてた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">房子的主人已成为仆人。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">家主</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やぬし</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">房东；房东太太；房主；住宅所有人；户主</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186959\"><ruby>家主<rp>(</rp><rt>やぬし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がドアを<ruby>赤<rp>(</rp><rt>あか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>塗<rp>(</rp><rt>ぬ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ることを<ruby>許<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してくれない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">主人不允许他把门画成红色。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">屋根</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">やね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">屋顶；房顶</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"109516\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>屋根<rp>(</rp><rt>やね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>雪<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>取<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り<ruby>除<rp>(</rp><rt>のぞ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他把雪从天花板上拿出来。</span></div></li>"]